@prefix ex:   <http://petrobras.exemplo/onto#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# Ciranda: uma mistura é a soma de itens de composição (componente + percentual); rotas ligam navios e portos.

ex:ComposicaoItem a owl:Class .
ex:Rota           a owl:Class .

ex:mistura      a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:ComposicaoItem .
ex:componente   a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:ComposicaoItem .
ex:percentual   a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:ComposicaoItem .
ex:grauAPI      a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:ComposicaoItem .
ex:teorEnxofre  a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:ComposicaoItem .

ex:navio        a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
ex:portoOrigem  a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
ex:portoDestino a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
ex:capacidade   a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
ex:janelaInicio a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
ex:janelaFim    a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Rota .
